1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
My work... My work here is done.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Yes. Well, I heard that kind of thing before, but it never happens.

3
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:32,000
You will see, Hoohoo. Don't worry.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Have you seen Owl? Ah!

5
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
...this forest isn't big enough for the both of us!

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Look, it's me! But... But...

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
So much water...

8
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:32,000
I have to destroy that dam!

9
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,000
all the laughs that we had...

10
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:56,000
to be part of MY MASTERPIECE.

11
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:08,000
There's plenty more where that came from!

12
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
We even have a small lake where you can live.
